title: "Red-eyed treefrog skin microbiome analysis"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-25
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Xiaoyi
repository-code: "https://github.com/xiaoyi-2024/red-eyed-treefrog-skin-microbiome"
url: "https://github.com/xiaoyi-2024/red-eyed-treefrog-skin-microbiome"
abstract: >-
  R code, processed ASV-level data, statistical outputs, figure source data,
  and PNG figures supporting an analysis of whole and candidate anti-Bd skin
  bacterial communities in red-eyed treefrogs from Costa Rica and Panama.
keywords:
  - Agalychnis callidryas
  - amphibian skin microbiome
  - Batrachochytrium dendrobatidis
  - anti-Bd bacteria
  - biogeography
  - community ecology
  - reproducible research
